[34a371db] 2026-11-02T02:20:45.460Z: Checked state and county FIPS, noticed discrepancy in 12 states with multiple county names. Make sure to pad county FIPS with leading zeros when comparing, not just state FIPS.
[e6b0f0c8] 2026-11-02T01:20:44.987Z: When comparing dates, always check the century first, not just the year.
[cc94e788] 2026-10-29T22:10:46.959Z: Pro tip: when generating addresses, lead zeros matter - 00123 doesn't equal 123 in decimal.